=== CODE-DESIGN ISSUES FOUND BY RUNNING (no red-as-green) ===
Running the suite surfaced (and this run FIXED) three real harness/test defects:
  1. -uiTestReduceMotion via .environment(\.accessibilityReduceMotion,true) does NOT
     compile — that key path is read-only in this SDK (any KeyPath & Sendable, not
     WritableKeyPath). Replaced with a transaction { disablesAnimations = true } proxy.
  2. anyElement(id) raised "multiple matching elements" for shell.commandPalette.button
     (one per tab toolbar on the compact idiom). Switched the helper to .firstMatch.
  3. The gallery's 6 page-state toggles sat below ~16 scroll-heights and could not be
     reached; moved the page-state section to the top of the gallery and gave the
     toggles short labels + an eager 2-row Grid. After each fix the suite re-ran:
     43 tests → 4 failures → 2 failures → 0 failures.

